  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Meteor Swarm is a game inspired by similar titles from the early arcade era.   You the player, take control of a spaceship trapped in the middle of a hectic meteor shower.\r\n\r\nLarge, slow-moving meteors drift randomly as you maneuver to dodge and shoot them.  When shot, the meteors will break into smaller pieces until they eventually disappear into space dust.  Then you move on the the next wave where things go faster and faster! Good luck!"
    }
  ],
